import numpy as np

DESCRIPTION = ("Pointer-chasing transformer. Layer-0 attention row i moves mass to the position holding token x_i, so the value path writes the embedding of x_i into position i: resid0[i] ~ e_i + e_{x_i} M0. "
 "Layer-1 attention then re-points (mostly to position 0 and along the orbit of node 4) and the class scores are read out of the layer-1 value path, "
 "whose matrix M1 = WV1@WO1 is combined with the unembedding. Exact re-implementation here with the two value/output pairs replaced by their products "
 "(M0 = WV0@WO0, M1 = WV1@WO1), which is the same computation with half the numbers; layer-1 values are 4-dimensional so M1 is rank 4.")

